[USER] I've used the following markdown to somewhat get around this. It does seem without sufficient padding at the top, some text can get cutoff.

```
    st.markdown(
        """
            <style>
                .appview-container .main .block-container {{
                    padding-top: {padding_top}rem;
                    padding-bottom: {padding_bottom}rem;
                    }}

            </style>""".format(
            padding_top=1, padding_bottom=1
        ),
        unsafe_allow_html=True,
    )
```

**Example No Markdown**

![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/13786338/226670352-12145de0-d782-4c73-ac67-bf9de44780a3.png)

